hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 1v13M3 9l5 5 5-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span></a><div class="hero__inner"><nav class="crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/services">Services</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><a href="/services#branding">Branding</a></nav><h1 aria-label="Logo Design"><span class="word" aria-hidden="true"><span class="letter">L</span><span class="letter">o</span><span class="letter">g</span><span class="letter">o</span></span> <span class="word" aria-hidden="true"><span class="letter">D</span><span class="letter">e</span><span class="letter">s</span><span class="letter">i</span><span class="letter">g</span><span class="letter">n</span></span></h1><div class="hero__side"><p class="hero__sub">A mark you repeat.</p><a href="#inquiry" class="cta cta--badge cta--klein cta--down hero__cta"><span class="cta__ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 1v13M3 9l5 5 5-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span>Skip to the inquiry</span></a></div></div></section><script type="module" src="<root>/src/components/sections/Hero.astro?astro&type=script&index=0&lang.ts"></script><section class="svc-what" id="what" aria-labelledby="svc-what-heading"><div class="svc-wrap"><div class="tag rv"><span class="dot"></span><span>The service</span></div><div class="svc-what__grid"><h2 class="svc-what__lead rv" id="svc-what-heading">A logo is a promise.</h2><div class="svc-what__text rv"><div class="svc-what__body"><p>We start from the name.</p></div><div class="svc-get"><h3 class="svc-get__k" id="svc-get-heading">What you get</h3><ul class="svc-get__list" role="list" aria-labelledby="svc-get-heading"><li><i aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2 6.5l2.6 2.6L10 3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></i><span>The mark</span></li><li><i aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2 6.5l2.6 2.6L10 3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></i><span>A usage sheet</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class="svc-val" aria-labelledby="svc-val-heading"><div class="svc-wrap"><div class="svc-val__head"><div><div class="tag rv"><span class="dot"></span><span>The value we add</span></div><h2 class="rv" id="svc-val-heading">Why it&#39;s <em>worth it</em></h2></div><p class="rv">What working with us adds, beyond a template or a one off freelancer.</p></div><ul class="svc-val__grid" role="list"><li class="rv"><div class="svc-vcard"><div class="svc-vcard__top" aria-hidden="true"><span class="svc-vcard__n">01</span><span class="svc-vcard__plus"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span></div><h3>One system</h3><p>Every use, one rule.</p></div></li><li class="rv"><div class="svc-vcard"><div class="svc-vcard__top" aria-hidden="true"><span class="svc-vcard__n">02</span><span class="svc-vcard__plus"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span></div><h3>Made to last</h3><p>No trend chasing.</p></div></li></ul></div></section><section class="hello" id="inquiry" aria-labelledby="hello-heading"><div class="hello__wrap"><div class="hello__grid"><div class="hello__side"><div class="tag tag--sky rv"><span class="dot"></span><span>Project inquiry</span></div><h2 class="hello__h rv hello__h--svc" id="hello-heading">Let&#39;s talk <em>Logo Design</em></h2><p class="hello__p rv">Tell us what you need and where it has to show up. You&#39;ll hear back within one business day with our questions and a rough range.</p><div class="hello__rule rv" aria-hidden="true"></div><ul class="hello__pts rv"><li><b aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></b><span>A reply within one business day</span></li><li><b aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></b><span>A fixed price once the scope is agreed</span></li><li><b aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M7 1v12M1 7h12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></b><span>One team from the first sketch to launch</span></li></ul></div><form id="contact-form" class="contact-form contact-form--full contact-form--hello" data-locale="en" data-kind="project_inquiry" data-form-variant="hello" data-err-required="This field is required." data-err-email="Enter a valid email address, like name@company.com." data-err-too-long="This is longer than we can accept." data-err-invalid="Please check this field." novalidate><div class="field"><label for="cf-name">Name</label><input id="cf-name" name="name" type="text" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your full name"></div><div class="field"><label for="cf-email">Email</label><input id="cf-email" name="email" type="email" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@company.com"></div><div class="field"><label for="cf-company">Company</label><input id="cf-company" name="company" type="text" maxlength="120" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Optional"></div><div class="field"><label for="cf-phone">Phone or WhatsApp</label><input id="cf-phone" name="phone" type="tel" dir="ltr" maxlength="32" autocomplete="tel" inputmode="tel" placeholder="+966 5X XXX XXXX"></div><div class="field"><label for="cf-service">What do you need?</label><select id="cf-service" name="service"><option value="">Not sure yet, let&#39;s talk</option><optgroup label="01 Branding"><option value="discipline:branding">Branding, help me choose</option><option value="logo" selected>Logo Design</option><option value="packaging">Packaging</option></optgroup><optgroup label="02 Production"><option value="discipline:production">Production, help me choose</option><option value="animation">Animation</option></optgroup></select></div><div class="field"><label for="cf-budget">Budget range</label><select id="cf-budget" name="budget"><option value="">Prefer to discuss</option><option value="lt_25k">Under 25k SAR</option><option value="25k_75k">25k to 75k SAR</option><option value="75k_200k">75k to 200k SAR</option><option value="gt_200k">200k SAR and up</option><option value="not_sure">Not sure yet</option></select></div><div class="field field-full"><label for="cf-message">Tell us about the project</label><textarea id="cf-message" name="message" required maxlength="5000" placeholder="What are you making, who is it for, and when does it need to be ready?"></textarea></div><div class="field field-full field-check"><input id="cf-consent" name="consent" type="checkbox"><label for="cf-consent">I agree to be contacted about my inquiry.</label></div><div class="hp-field" aria-hidden="true"><label for="cf-hp">Leave this field empty</label><input id="cf-hp" name="hp" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div><input type="hidden" name="required_fields" value><div class="contact-form__foot field-full"><button type="submit" class="cta cta--badge cta--klein cta--go"><span class="cta__ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M2 8h12M9 3l5 5-5 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span>Send a message</span></button><p class="contact-form__note">We read everything and reply within one business day.</p></div><p id="contact-status" class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1" hidden data-sending="Sending…" data-ok="Got it. We'll be in touch within one business day." data-invalid="Please correct the marked fields and try again." data-rate-limited="Too many attempts. Please wait a minute and try again." data-unavailable="The form isn’t live yet — please email hello@braiinstatiion.com." data-error="Something went wrong. Please try again."></p></form><script type="module" src="<root>/src/components/ContactForm.astro?astro&type=script&index=0&lang.ts"></script></div></div></section><section class="svc-more" aria-labelledby="svc-more-heading"><div class="svc-wrap"><div class="svc-more__head"><div><div class="tag rv"><span class="dot"></span><span>More in Branding</span></div><h2 class="rv" id="svc-more-heading">Everything in <em>Branding</em></h2></div><a class="svc-more__all rv" href="/services">All services</a></div><ol class="svc-more__list" role="list"><li class="svc-more__row is-here"><a href="/services/logo" aria-current="page"><span class="svc-more__n" aria-hidden="true">01</span><span class="svc-more__t">Logo Design</span></a></li><li class="svc-more__row"><a href="/services/packaging"><span class="svc-more__n" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span class="svc-more__t">Packaging</span></a></li></ol></div></section><div class="svc-fab__mark" aria-hidden="true"></div><a class="svc-fab" href="#inquiry" inert aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-track="skip_to_inquiry"><span class="svc-fab__ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 1v13M3 9l5 5 5-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span><span>Skip to inquiry</span></a><script type="module" src="<root>/src/components/service/ServiceFab.astro?astro&type=script&index=0&lang.ts"></script></main><script type="module" src="<root>/src/components/service/ServicePage.astro?astro&type=script&index=0&lang.ts"></script></div><footer class="site-footer"><div class="site-footer__bar"><p class="site-footer__copy">© 2026 Braiin Statiion. Jeddah, Saudi Arabia</p><a class="site-footer__mail" href="mailto:hello@braiinstatiion.com" dir="ltr" data-track="email">hello@braiinstatiion.com</a></div><div class="site-footer__links"><nav aria-label="Footer navigation"><ul class="site-footer__list"><li><a href="/services">Services</a></li><li><a href="/portfolio">Our Work</a></li><li><a href="/creative-knowledge">Insights</a></li><li><a href="/about">About</a></li><li><a href="/contact" data-track="contact_link">Contact</a></li><li><a href="/join">Join</a></li></ul></nav><nav aria-label="Legal"><ul class="site-footer__list"><li><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></li><li><a href="/terms">Terms</a></li><li><a href="/cookie-policy">Cookies</a></li></ul></nav></div></footer><div id="consent-banner" class="consent-banner" data-version="1" hidden role="region" aria-label="Cookie consent"><p class="consent-text">We use functional cookies to run the site, and — only with your consent — first-party analytics to improve it. See our <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a>.</p><div class="consent-actions"><button type="button" data-consent="reject">Reject non-essential</button><button type="button" data-consent="accept">Accept analytics</button></div></div><script type="module" src="<root>/src/components/ConsentBanner.astro?astro&type=script&index=0&lang.ts"></script><script type="module" src="<root>/src/components/WebVitals.astro?astro&type=script&index=0&lang.ts"></script><script type="module" src="<root>/src/components/PageView.astro?astro&type=script&index=0&lang.ts"></script><script type="module" src="<root>/src/components/ErrorReporter.astro?astro&type=script&index=0&lang.ts"></script><script type="module" src="<root>/src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro?astro&type=script&index=0&lang.ts"></script></body></html>"`;
